{"type": "longaudio", "title": "Naval Topic 3 生词 · 英英解释", "audio": "audio/t03v/full.mp3", "items": [{"n": 1, "w": "insight", "pos": "n.", "zh": "洞见；深刻的见解", "ex": "An insight is a clear, deep understanding of something, often a surprising one. Chris says one of your insights to mean one of Naval's smart ideas. We often say gain insight into something.", "exs": ["That book gave me real insight into how money works.", "Thanks, that's a great insight."], "t": 0.0, "tt": {"w": 0.0, "ex": [["An", 2.56], ["insight", 2.56], ["is", 2.9], ["a", 3.28], ["clear,", 3.36], ["deep", 3.66], ["understanding", 4.24], ["of", 4.96], ["something,", 5.68], ["often", 6.4], ["a", 6.4], ["surprising", 6.52], ["one.", 7.02], ["Chris", 8.24], ["says", 8.32], ["one", 8.64], ["of", 8.88], ["your", 8.98], ["insights", 9.08], ["to", 9.5], ["mean", 9.9], ["one", 10.04], ["of", 10.3], ["Naval's", 10.42], ["smart", 10.92], ["ideas.", 11.16], ["We", 12.4], ["often", 12.66], ["say", 12.9], ["gain", 13.48], ["insight", 13.6], ["into", 14.28], ["something.", 14.6]], "exs": [[["That", 18.05], ["book", 18.14], ["gave", 18.3], ["me", 18.58], ["real", 18.78], ["insight", 19.28], ["into", 19.78], ["how", 20.22], ["money", 20.43], ["works.", 20.64]], [["Thanks,", 30.46], ["that's", 30.71], ["a", 31.05], ["great", 31.11], ["insight.", 31.25]]], "z": [21.78, 32.67], "r": [25.83, 35.05], "o": 37.86, "rx": [[25.83, 25.92, 26.08, 26.36, 26.56, 27.06, 27.56, 28.0, 28.21, 28.42], [35.05, 35.3, 35.64, 35.7, 35.84]]}, "src": {"t": "I think it’s quicker in some ways. One of your insights is it’s far easier to achieve our material desires than it is to renounce them.", "a": "audio/t03/s01.mp3", "hl": [47, 55], "sp": "Chris", "oa": "audio/t03o/s01.mp3", "oab": [2.99, 5.66], "oas": ["audio/t03o/s01.mp3"], "zh": "我觉得在某些方面这样更快。你有个观点是：实现物质欲望，比放下它们要容易得多。", "sg": [[0, 34, "audio/t03o/s01.mp3", 0, 2.99], [35, 63, "audio/t03o/s01.mp3", 2.99, 5.66], [64, 85, "audio/t03o/s01.mp3", 5.66, 6.5], [86, 135, "audio/t03o/s01.mp3", 6.5, 8.74]]}}, {"n": 2, "w": "quip", "pos": "v./n.", "zh": "说俏皮话；妙语", "ex": "To quip means to say something short, clever and a little funny. I quipped that means Naval once said it as a witty line. Quipped is the past tense.", "exs": ["\"At least the coffee's good,\" she quipped.", "He's always ready with a quick quip."], "t": 47.91, "tt": {"w": 47.91, "ex": [["To", 50.32], ["quip", 50.32], ["means", 50.45], ["to", 50.69], ["say", 50.95], ["something", 51.15], ["short,", 51.26], ["clever", 51.37], ["and", 51.57], ["a", 53.07], ["little", 53.15], ["funny.", 53.31], ["I", 54.39], ["quipped", 54.58], ["that", 54.77], ["means", 55.07], ["Naval", 55.38], ["once", 55.69], ["said", 55.99], ["it", 56.27], ["as", 56.45], ["a", 56.61], ["witty", 56.69], ["line.", 56.87], ["Quipped", 57.69], ["is", 58.15], ["the", 58.31], ["past", 58.43], ["tense.", 58.67]], "exs": [[["\"At", 62.37], ["least", 62.57], ["the", 62.61], ["coffee's", 62.94], ["good,\"", 63.27], ["she", 63.89], ["quipped.", 63.99]], [["He's", 71.74], ["always", 71.77], ["ready", 71.93], ["with", 72.49], ["a", 72.71], ["quick", 72.83], ["quip.", 73.15]]], "z": [65.03, 74.07], "r": [68.08, 77.07], "o": 80.0, "rx": [[68.08, 68.28, 68.32, 68.65, 68.98, 69.6, 69.7], [77.07, 77.1, 77.26, 77.82, 78.04, 78.16, 78.48]]}, "src": {"t": "I quipped that the reason to win the game is to be free of it,", "a": "audio/t03/s03.mp3", "hl": [2, 9], "sp": "Naval", "oa": "audio/t03o/s03.mp3", "oab": [0, 1.37], "oas": ["audio/t03o/s03.mp3", "audio/t03o/s04.mp3"], "ft": "I quipped that the reason to win the game is to be free of it, so you play the games, you win the games, and then hopefully, you get bored of the games.", "fhl": [2, 9], "zh": "我开玩笑说过，赢下这场游戏，就是为了从中解脱，所以你去玩游戏、赢游戏，然后但愿你会玩腻。", "sg": [[0, 14, "audio/t03o/s03.mp3", 0, 1.37], [15, 62, "audio/t03o/s03.mp3", 1.37, 4.09], [63, 113, "audio/t03o/s04.mp3", 0, 3.59], [114, 152, "audio/t03o/s04.mp3", 3.59, 5.15]]}}, {"n": 3, "w": "hopefully", "pos": "adv.", "zh": "但愿；希望（如此）", "ex": "Hopeful